  "shared_work_module_law": [
    "same work-module contract may be assigned to many agents in one or more sector groups",
    "capability gaps become addressable HOLE states",
    "resident capabilities are reused before synthesis",
    "generated functions require requirement/test/provenance evidence",
    "generator, verifier and promoter are segregated roles",
    "execution receipts return to BRAINK federation state",
    "observer evidence informs reconciliation but does not create execution permission"
